  {
    "target": "hero-knight",
    "compose": "single",
    "kind": "character",
    "game": "rpg",
    "background": "#00FF00",
    "subject": "a round blob knight: a round steel helmet with the visor open and a red plume on top, a blue tunic with a belt on the lower half",
    "references": [
      {
        "ref": "swords/broadsword",
        "role": "family"
      },
      {
        "ref": "shields/kite-shield",
        "role": "family"
      }
    ],
    "notes": "The front hand floats ahead on the right and grips the sword pointing up. The back hand floats on the left and holds the kite shield. Copy the held items' shape and colours from the reference images, drawn small enough for the hand. CHARACTER SHAPE: a super chibi round blob hero, like a round kawaii mascot. The head and body are ONE soft rounded blob, about as wide as it is tall, a little wider at the bottom. No neck, no arms, no legs. Two small round mitten hands FLOAT beside the blob, apart from it with a little background between hand and blob. Two small round feet peek out under the bottom of the blob. Three-quarter view facing right: the dot eyes, the face and the toes point to the right. Tiny solid dark dot eyes and a tiny mouth. The hero's outfit is drawn on the blob: helmet, hat, hood, hair or beard on the top, clothes and belt on the lower half. Lineless and simple like the rest of the set."
  },
